#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/simulation.rst:98
msgid "Running the test suite"
msgstr "Köra testsviten"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/simulation.rst:100
msgid ""
"The unit tests live in ``scripts/unittest/tests/``, with their fixture "
"images and data in ``scripts/unittest/data/``. They are run with `mpremote "
"<https://docs.micropython.org/en/latest/reference/mpremote.html>`__, which "
"mounts ``scripts/unittest/`` onto the running simulator and executes its "
"``run.py``."
msgstr ""
"Enhetstesterna ligger i ``scripts/unittest/tests/``\\ , med sina "
"fixturbilder och data i ``scripts/unittest/data/``\\ . De körs med `mpremote"
" <https://docs.micropython.org/en/latest/reference/mpremote.html>`__, som "
"monterar ``scripts/unittest/`` på den körande simulatorn och kör dess "
"``run.py``\\ ."

